    "A group with a reading plan now shows everyone's progress, with a tick for who has read today.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un grupo con plan de lectura ahora muestra el progreso de todos, con una marca para quien ya leyó hoy."
